# `\xHH` in a BYTE literal `b'..'` takes the full `0x00-0xFF` range and
# yields the raw byte value (an IntLiteral). `b'\xFF'` is 255 (Rust model),
# where a String `"\xFF"` would REJECT. POS pin for the byte-ness axis cell.
void main():
    print(b'\xFF')
    print(b'\x00')
    print(b'\x41')
    print(b'\x7f')
    print(b'\x80')
